WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:02.250
Eight people sit round a table.

2
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:06.150
A card shows one line,
then three more labelled A,

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.760
B and C.

4
00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:09.620
One obviously matches.

5
00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:11.340
It isn't even close.

6
00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:13.690
The first person gives the wrong letter.

7
00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:15.210
So does the second.

8
00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:16.600
Then the third.

9
00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:19.540
All seven, calm and confident.

10
00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:23.100
Now it's your turn, and
every head turns to you.

11
00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:26.220
Say what you see, or agree with the group?

12
00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:29.440
In this mission, you'll
learn what conformity is:

13
00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:33.030
changing your behaviour or
opinions to match a group.

14
00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:35.760
You'll find out whether the
size of the group matters,

15
00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:39.100
and whether answering in
private changes anything.

16
00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:43.910
Your mission: work out what you would
really do when the whole room disagrees

17
00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:44.930
with your eyes.
